SUMMARY:Cold Water/L'eau froide | City Lights Film Series
DESCRIPTION:One of the earliest films by renowned director Olivier Assaya
 s\, Cold Water depicts troubled and passionate youth in 1970s France. Fea
 turing a memorable soundtrack\, it follows teenage lovers Gilles (Cyprien
  Fouquet) and Christine (Virginie Ledoyen) as they embody a rebellious sp
 irit in an attempt to escape their dysfunctional reality. [95 min\; drama
 \; French with English subtitles]
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  One of the earliest films by renowned d
 irector Olivier Assayas\, <i>Cold Water</i> depicts troubled and passiona
 te youth in 1970s France. Featuring a memorable soundtrack\, it follows t
 eenage lovers Gilles (Cyprien Fouquet) and Christine (Virginie Ledoyen) a
 s they embody a rebellious spirit in an attempt to escape their dysfuncti
 onal reality. [95 min\; drama\; French with English subtitles]</p>
